<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
        <title>Contrat de vente d'une voiture d'occasion</title>
        <style>
            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }
            html,
            body {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                background: #ddd;
                font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
                color: #000;
            }
            body {
                padding: 18px 0;
            }
            .page {
                width: 210mm;
                height: 297mm;
                margin: 0 auto 18px;
                background: #fff;
                position: relative;
                padding: 7.8mm 12.3mm 7.2mm 12.3mm;
                overflow: hidden;
                font-size: 3.12mm;
                line-height: 1.12;
                box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            }
            .brand-header {
                height: 15mm;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                margin-bottom: 1.5mm;
            }
            .brand-header img {
                max-height: 13mm;
                max-width: 55mm;
                width: auto;
                height: auto;
            }
            .head {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 3.2mm;
                margin-bottom: 0.5mm;
            }
            .head-line {
                height: 0.25mm;
                background: #000;
                flex: 1;
            }
            h1 {
                margin: 0;
                white-space: nowrap;
                font-size: 5.2mm;
                line-height: 1;
                font-weight: 800;
                font-variant: small-caps;
                letter-spacing: 0.05mm;
            }
            .top-meta {
                position: relative;
                height: 5.4mm;
                margin-bottom: 0.5mm;
            }
            .between {
                position: absolute;
                left: 2.2mm;
                top: 0.4mm;
                font-style: italic;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #666;
                font-size: 3.2mm;
            }
            .copy {
                position: absolute;
                right: 21mm;
                top: -0.7mm;
                font-style: italic;
                color: #777;
                font-size: 4mm;
            }
            .copy b {
                color: #1474c4;
                font-weight: 400;
            }

            .party {
                margin-left: 15.7mm;
                width: 145mm;
            }
            .party h2,
            .section h2 {
                font-size: 4.5mm;
                margin: 0 0 2.2mm 0;
                line-height: 1;
                font-weight: 700;
            }
            .fieldrow {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-end;
                gap: 1.2mm;
                margin: 0 0 1.7mm 0;
                min-height: 3.8mm;
            }
            .label {
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            .dots {
                flex: 1;
                border-bottom: 0.35mm dotted #555;
                height: 3mm;
            }
            .fixeddots {
                border-bottom: 0.35mm dotted #555;
                height: 3mm;
                display: inline-block;
            }
            .w12 {
                width: 12mm;
            }
            .w18 {
                width: 18mm;
            }
            .w22 {
                width: 22mm;
            }
            .w28 {
                width: 28mm;
            }
            .w34 {
                width: 34mm;
            }
            .w44 {
                width: 44mm;
            }
            .w52 {
                width: 52mm;
            }
            .w62 {
                width: 62mm;
            }
            .connector {
                margin-left: 8.1mm;
                margin-top: -0.5mm;
                margin-bottom: 1.6mm;
                font-style: italic;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #666;
            }
            .buyer {
                margin-top: 0;
            }

            .vehicle-wrap {
                position: relative;
                margin-top: 2.3mm;
                padding-left: 15.7mm;
            }
            .for {
                position: absolute;
                left: 2.3mm;
                top: 1.5mm;
                font-style: italic;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #666;
                font-size: 3.2mm;
            }
            .vehicle-top {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-end;
                gap: 2.5mm;
            }
            .vehicle-title {
                font-size: 4.9mm;
                font-weight: 700;
                white-space: nowrap;
                margin-bottom: 0.4mm;
            }
            .pricebox {
                flex: 1;
                border: 0.35mm solid #555;
                height: 13.4mm;
                padding: 1.2mm 2mm;
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
                grid-template-rows: auto auto;
                column-gap: 3mm;
                align-items: center;
            }
            .pricebox .ptitle {
                font-size: 4.8mm;
                font-weight: 700;
                line-height: 0.92;
            }
            .pricebox .pleft {
                font-size: 2.6mm;
                font-weight: 700;
                line-height: 1;
            }
            .pricebox .price-line {
                border-bottom: 0.35mm dotted #555;
                height: 3.3mm;
                position: relative;
            }
            .pricebox .eur {
                position: absolute;
                left: 50%;
                transform: translateX(-50%);
                top: -1.7mm;
                font-size: 4mm;
                font-weight: 700;
                background: #fff;
                padding: 0 1.8mm;
            }
            .pricebox .euros {
                text-align: right;
                font-size: 2.7mm;
            }

            .section {
                margin-left: 15.7mm;
                width: 145mm;
                margin-top: 2mm;
            }
            .twocol {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                column-gap: 8mm;
                row-gap: 4mm;
            }
            .sm {
                font-size: 2.85mm;
            }
            .row {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-end;
                gap: 3mm;
                margin-bottom: 1.8mm;
            }
            .checkline {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 1.3mm;
                margin: 1.15mm 0;
            }
            .checkline.two {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                gap: 2mm;
            }
            input[type="checkbox"] {

                -webkit-appearance: none;

                width: 3.2mm;
                height: 3.2mm;

                border: 0.28mm solid black;
                background: #fff;

                margin: 0;
                flex: 0 0 auto;

                position: relative;
                cursor: pointer;
            }
            .damage {
                margin-top: 1mm;
                margin-left: 5.6mm;
            }
            .damage .dots {
                display: block;
                margin: 1.1mm 0;
                width: 136mm;
            }
            .docs {
                margin-top: 2.6mm;
            }
            .docs-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                column-gap: 7mm;
                row-gap: 1.2mm;
            }
            .docs-grid label {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 1.2mm;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            .payline {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-end;
                gap: 1mm;
                margin-top: 1.7mm;
            }
            .smallchecks {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                gap: 2.5mm;
                margin-top: 1.5mm;
                font-size: 2.25mm;
                line-height: 1.15;
            }
            .smallchecks label {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 1.1mm;
            }
            .legal {
                font-size: 2.65mm;
                line-height: 1.18;
                margin-top: 2.1mm;
            }
            .legal p {
                margin: 0 0 1.1mm 0;
            }
            .received {
                margin-top: 2.8mm;
                font-size: 2.8mm;
            }
            .done {
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-end;
                gap: 1mm;
                margin-top: 2.8mm;
                font-size: 3.15mm;
            }
            .signatures {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 3.2mm;
                font-weight: 700;
                font-size: 2.75mm;
            }

            .footer-note {
                position: absolute;
                left: 12.3mm;
                right: 12.3mm;
                bottom: 5.6mm;
                height: 14.1mm;
                border: 0.35mm solid #555;
                padding: 2.1mm 3mm;
                font-size: 2.18mm;
                line-height: 1.13;
            }
            .footer-logo {
                position: absolute;
                right: 10.5mm;
                bottom: 4.8mm;
                width: 41.5mm;
                height: auto;
            }

            @media print {
                html,
                body {
                    background: #fff;
                    padding: 0;
                }
                .page {
                    margin: 0;
                    box-shadow: none;
                    page-break-after: always;
                }
                .page:last-child {
                    page-break-after: auto;
                }
            }
            input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
                background: #fff;
                border-color: #C98800;
            }

            input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
                content: "✓";

                position: absolute;
                left: 50%;
                top: 50%;

                transform: translate(-50%, -57%);

                color: #C98800;
                font-size: 3.2mm;
                font-weight: 900;
                line-height: 1;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
   
        <section class="page">
            <div class="brand-header">
                <img
                    alt="{{site_setting('company_name')}}"
                    src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
                />
            </div>
            <div class="head">
                <span class="head-line"></span>
                <h1>Contrat de vente d’une voiture d’occasion</h1>
                <span class="head-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="top-meta">
                <span class="between">entre</span>
            </div>

            <div class="party">
                <h2>Le vendeur</h2>
                <div class="fieldrow"><span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Raison sociale :</span><span class="dots">{{site_setting('company_name')}}</span></div>
                <div class="fieldrow"><span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Adresse :</span><span class="dots">{{site_setting('company_address')}}</span></div>
                <div class="fieldrow">
                    <span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">CP :</span><span class="fixeddots w28">{{site_setting('company_cp')}}</span
                    ><span class="label" style="margin-left: 5mm">Ville :</span><span class="dots">{{site_setting('company_city')}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="fieldrow">
                <span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Tél :</span><span class="dots">{{site_setting('company_phone')}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="fieldrow">
                    <span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Numéro SIRET :</span><span class="dots">{{site_setting('company_registration')}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="connector">et</div>
            <div class="party buyer">
                <h2>L’acheteur</h2>
                <div class="fieldrow"><span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Nom/Prénom :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.customerName}}</span></div>
               {% if reservation.receptionMode.name == 'DELIVERY' %}
                    <div class="fieldrow"><span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Adresse :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.deliveryAddress}}</span></div>
                    <div class="fieldrow">
                        <span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">CP :</span><span class="fixeddots w28">{{reservation.deliveryPostalCode}}</span
                        ><span class="label" style="margin-left: 5mm">Ville :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.deliveryCity}}</span>
                    </div>
                {% else %}
                    <div class="fieldrow"><span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Adresse :</span><span class="dots"></span></div>
                    <div class="fieldrow">
                        <span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">CP :</span><span class="fixeddots w28"></span
                        ><span class="label" style="margin-left: 5mm">Ville :</span><span class="dots"></span>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="fieldrow">
                   <span class="label" style="margin-left: 2mm">Tél :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.customerPhone}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="fieldrow">
                    <span class="label" style="font-weight:bold;">Numéro Carte identité/Passeport :</span><span class="dots">{{cardIdNumber}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vehicle-wrap">
                <span class="for">pour</span>
                <div class="vehicle-top">
                    <div class="vehicle-title">Le véhicule</div>
                    <div class="pricebox">
                        <div>
                            <div class="ptitle">Prix convenu</div>
                            <div class="pleft">(en chiffres et en lettres)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="price-line"><span class="eur">{{reservation.vehicle.price}} €</span></div>
                            <div class="euros">euros</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section sm">
                <div class="twocol">
                    <div class="row"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Marque (D.1) :</span><span class="dots" style="font-weight:bold;">{{reservation.vehicle.brand}} </span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Type (D.2):</span><span class="dots"></span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Modèle (D.3) :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.vehicle.model}} </span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Puissance (P.6):</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.vehicle.power}} ch  / {{reservation.vehicle.powerCv}} cv</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="twocol">
                    <div class="row"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Numéro d’immatriculation :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.vehicle.immatriculation ?? 'N/A'}}</span></div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <span style="font-weight:bold;">Date de 1ère mise en circulation (B) :</span><span class="fixeddots w34">{{reservation.vehicle.datePremiereMiseEnCirculation ?? 'N/A'}}</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="twocol">
                    <div class="row"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Numéro de Chassis - Code VIN (E) :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.vehicle.vim ?? 'N/A'}}</span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Kilométrage :</span><span class="dots">{{reservation.vehicle.mileage ?? 'N/A'}}</span><span>km</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <span style="font-weight:bold;">Certificat de Contrôle Technique valable jusqu’au (mois/année) :</span
                    ><span class="dots">{{reservation.vehicle.ctValidity ?? 'N/A'}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <span style="font-weight:bold;">Nombre de propriétaires précédents :</span><span class="fixeddots w18">{{reservation.vehicle.nbOwner ?? 'N/A'}}</span
                    ><span style="margin-left: 5mm"><input type="checkbox" checked /> moteur d’origine</span
                    ><span style="margin-left: 4mm"><input type="checkbox" /> moteur changé</span>
                </div>

                <div class="checkline two">
                    <label><input type="checkbox" checked/> le véhicule n’est pas accidenté</label
                    ><label><input type="checkbox" checked/> N’a pas de défauts connus</label>
                </div>
                <div class="checkline">
                    <label><input type="checkbox" /> présente les défauts ou dommages suivants :</label>
                </div>
                <div class="damage"><span class="dots"></span><span class="dots"></span></div>
                <div class="checkline two" style="margin-top: 1.8mm">
                    <label><input type="checkbox" /> le véhicule n’est pas importé</label
                    ><label><input type="checkbox" checked/> véhicule importé (UE ou autre)</label>
                </div>

                <div class="docs">
                    <h2>Documents à remettre à l’acheteur</h2>
                    <div class="docs-grid">
                        <label><input type="checkbox" checked/> Certificat de cession</label>
                        <label><input type="checkbox" checked/> Certificat d’immatriculation (carte grise)</label>
                        <label><input type="checkbox" checked/> Certificat de non-gage (situation administrative)</label>
                        <label><input type="checkbox" checked/> Certificat de visite Contrôle technique</label>
                        <label><input type="checkbox"checked /> Certificat COC (si import UE ou autre)</label>
                        <label><input type="checkbox" checked/> Remise des clefs</label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payline">
                        <span><input type="checkbox" checked /> Le vendeur confirme qu’il a reçu la somme de</span
                        ><span class="dots" style="font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;">{{reservation.vehicle.price}}</span><span>€</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="smallchecks">
                        <label
                            ><input type="checkbox" checked /> Le vendeur s’engage à faire la télédéclaration de la vente du
                            véhicule sur le site : ants.gouv.fr</label
                        >
                        <label
                            ><input type="checkbox" checked/> L’acheteur s’engage à procéder au transfert du certificat
                            d’immatriculation dans les délais légaux.</label
                        >
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="legal">
                    <p>
                        Le véhicule est vendu avec une garantie de 12 mois , dans l’état dans lequel il se trouve et connu de
                        l’acheteur à l’issu d’un essai sur route et d’un examen approfondi.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Le vendeur affirme que le véhicule fourni est sa propriété, libre de toutes charges et
                        restrictions.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="received">Chaque partie a reçu un exemplaire du présent document.</div>
                <div class="done">
                    <span>Fait à</span><span class="fixeddots w44">{{site_setting('company_city')}}</span><span>le :</span
                    ><span class="fixeddots w34">{{dateEtablissementContrat}}</span><span>à</span><span class="fixeddots w12">{{heureContrat}}</span
                    ><span>heures</span><span class="fixeddots w12">{{minuteContrat}}</span><span>minutes.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="signatures">
                    <div>Signature du vendeur</div>
                    <div> 
                        Signature de l’acheteur 
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-note">
                Le présent contrat formalise la vente du véhicule décrit ci-dessus entre le vendeur et l’acheteur. Les
                parties déclarent avoir pris connaissance de l’ensemble des informations relatives au véhicule, aux
                conditions de la vente et aux documents remis. Par leur signature, elles reconnaissent accepter sans
                réserve les conditions du présent contrat et attestent de l’exactitude des informations qui y figurent.
            </div>
            
        </section>
    </body>
</html>
